# ThreadSanitizer suppressions of the IMG2_SANITIZE=thread build (scripts/sanitize.sh, docs/sanitizers.md).
# Vendor frames only, never a libimg2 frame. One entry per documented finding.

# libde265 (util.cc:50, DE265_LOGGING): log_set_current_POC() writes the file-static current_poc without a lock
# from every decoder context; libheif decodes the tiles of a grid image on several threads (std::async), each with
# its own libde265 decoder, so the writes race. Debug-log state only (upstream libde265 issue #535, acknowledged
# in the source). Reproducer: test_heif_exif_integration (grid HEIC fixtures).
race:log_set_current_POC
